Z||000000||Ditz88GT||12-06-1999||11:01 AM||||Hello all, I'm working on putting more pictures on my website and I was wondering if any of you would send me pictures of your Fieros.  I read the forum everyday and can't believe how much some of you know about these cars.  This tells me there must be some real nice Fieros out there.  Presently I only have pictures of my Fiero and three others, but I really want to have more pics.  So if you could e-mail me a few, and a short description of what it is (i.e., 3.2, V8, 12" subs, T-Tops) I would really appreciate it.  For now if you want to check out my site go to <A HREF="http://go.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://go.to/fiero.</A>   My e-mail address is cditzler@bellatlantic.net.  Please use this address, my hotmail account can not accept large files.  Thanks, Ditz88GT<p>[This message has been edited by Ditz88GT (edited 12-06-1999).]||||reg||5
Z||000001||loafer87gt||12-06-1999||12:35 PM||||I'll send you through the pictures of my old 87 GT's stereo setup. This baby rocked, I had SAS build me a pair of custom boxes that fit behind the seats (only about 3 inches deep) and were filled with acoustic stuffing to trick the subs into thinking that they were in a bigger box. I had four 10" subs in there before some little punk stole my car and stripped my baby of her interior and the subs. The bastards even took a crowbar and pried open my decklid to get my amp. Well, enough of my rant, I'm still kinda choked about it though.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Ditz88GT||12-06-1999||12:46 PM||||Man, that is horrible.  I hope insurance coved some of your losses.  Sounds like you put a lot of time and money into it.  I hate to hear stories like this, but I do look forward to seeing your pictures.||||reg||9
